---
// src/components/WorkflowJourney.astro
---

<section id="workflow" class="py-24 relative overflow-hidden bg-[#060812]">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Section 13: What is LIFT? -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-16">
      <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-indigo-400 font-mono">Platform Architecture</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-white font-heading tracking-tight mt-2">
        The operating layer for modern due diligence.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        LIFT is a smart DD platform designed to coordinate the people, information and workflows involved in due diligence.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
        From defining the scope and collecting documents to engaging experts, managing queries, identifying risks and producing decision-ready reports, LIFT brings the process together in one place.
      </p>

      <!-- Section 13: Feature Strip -->
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        {['Plan', 'Collect', 'Assign', 'Analyse', 'Query', 'Identify', 'Report', 'Decide'].map((step, idx) => (
          <span class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-200 flex items-center gap-1.5 font-mono">
            <span class="text-indigo-400 font-bold">{idx + 1}.</span>
            <span>{step}</span>
          </span>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 14: The LIFT Workflow (01 to 08 Journey) -->
    <div class="mt-16">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-4 border-b border-white/10 mb-8">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white font-heading">The 8-Stage Diligence Workflow</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-0.5">Continuous execution path from initial scope to investment decision</p>
        </div>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-indigo-400 hidden sm:inline-block">Traceable & Auditable</span>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
        
        <!-- 01 - DEFINE -->
        <div class="glass-panel rounded-2xl p-6 border border-white/5 hover:border-indigo-500/30 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-indigo-500/10 text-indigo-400 font-mono font-bold flex items-center justify-center mb-5 border border-indigo-500/20">
              01
            </div>
            <div class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase text-indigo-300 tracking-wider">DEFINE</div>
            <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white font-heading mt-1">Start with the right questions</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
              Create structured DD checklists based on transaction type, industry, business model, investor requirements, DD scope, and specific risk areas.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6 pt-3 border-t border-white/5 text-[11px] text-slate-400">
            Tailored scoping engine
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 02 - COLLECT -->
        <div class="glass-panel rounded-2xl p-6 border border-white/5 hover:border-blue-500/30 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-400 font-mono font-bold flex items-center justify-center mb-5 border border-blue-500/20">
              02
            </div>
            <div class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase text-blue-300 tracking-wider">COLLECT</div>
            <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white font-heading mt-1">Build a structured data room</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
              Organise documents by DD workstream and map files to specific requirements with clear state tracking:
            </p>
            <div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 text-[10px] font-mono">
              <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-800 text-slate-300">Requested</span>
              <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-blue-500/20 text-blue-300">Received</span>
              <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-300">Under Review</span>
              <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-300">Accepted</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6 pt-3 border-t border-white/5 text-[11px] text-slate-400">
            Automated file mapping
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 03 - ASSIGN -->
        <div class="glass-panel rounded-2xl p-6 border border-white/5 hover:border-purple-500/30 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-purple-500/10 text-purple-400 font-mono font-bold flex items-center justify-center mb-5 border border-purple-500/20">
              03
            </div>
            <div class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase text-purple-300 tracking-wider">ASSIGN</div>
            <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white font-heading mt-1">Right expert on the right question</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
              Bring together specialists across Finance, Tax, Corporate, Legal, IP, Commercial, Technology, Valuation, and Sector domain expertise into one coordinated hub.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6 pt-3 border-t border-white/5 text-[11px] text-slate-400">
            Granular role isolation
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 04 - ANALYSE -->
        <div class="glass-panel rounded-2xl p-6 border border-white/5 hover:border-cyan-500/30 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-cyan-500/10 text-cyan-400 font-mono font-bold flex items-center justify-center mb-5 border border-cyan-500/20">
              04
            </div>
            <div class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase text-cyan-300 tracking-wider">ANALYSE</div>
            <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white font-heading mt-1">Review against defined parameters</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
              Support expert-led evaluation with structured workflows and technology-assisted document intelligence to extract clauses, verify schedules, and inspect consistency.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6 pt-3 border-t border-white/5 text-[11px] text-slate-400">
            AI-assisted. Expert-verified.
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 05 - QUERY -->
        <div class="glass-panel rounded-2xl p-6 border border-white/5 hover:border-emerald-500/30 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 font-mono font-bold flex items-center justify-center mb-5 border border-emerald-500/20">
              05
            </div>
            <div class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase text-emerald-300 tracking-wider">QUERY</div>
            <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white font-heading mt-1">Turn questions into structured conversations</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
              Create, assign, respond to, and resolve DD queries within one workspace. No crucial questions lost in private messaging threads.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6 pt-3 border-t border-white/5 text-[11px] text-slate-400">
            Full conversational audit trail
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 06 - IDENTIFY -->
        <div class="glass-panel rounded-2xl p-6 border border-white/5 hover:border-amber-500/30 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-400 font-mono font-bold flex items-center justify-center mb-5 border border-amber-500/20">
              06
            </div>
            <div class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase text-amber-300 tracking-wider">IDENTIFY</div>
            <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white font-heading mt-1">Capture what matters</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
              Systematically record risks, red flags, compliance gaps, observations, exceptions, and remediation recommendations tied to evidence.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6 pt-3 border-t border-white/5 text-[11px] text-slate-400">
            Severity categorization
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 07 - REPORT -->
        <div class="glass-panel rounded-2xl p-6 border border-white/5 hover:border-rose-500/30 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-rose-500/10 text-rose-400 font-mono font-bold flex items-center justify-center mb-5 border border-rose-500/20">
              07
            </div>
            <div class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase text-rose-300 tracking-wider">REPORT</div>
            <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white font-heading mt-1">See the picture as work progresses</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
              Generate evolving Flash DD™ snapshots, workstream reports, and consolidated final reports without weeks of manual aggregation.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6 pt-3 border-t border-white/5 text-[11px] text-slate-400">
            Continuous synthesis
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 08 - DECIDE -->
        <div class="glass-panel rounded-2xl p-6 border border-emerald-500/30 bg-emerald-500/5 hover:border-emerald-500/50 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-300 font-mono font-bold flex items-center justify-center mb-5 border border-emerald-500/30">
              08
            </div>
            <div class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase text-emerald-400 tracking-wider">DECIDE</div>
            <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white font-heading mt-1">From diligence to decision intelligence</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
              The ultimate objective is not a report. It is a better decision. Clear evidence traceability equips committees to deploy capital with confidence.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6 pt-3 border-t border-emerald-500/20 text-[11px] text-emerald-400 font-medium">
            IC-ready actionable insights
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
